log</strong><p>Prerequisites: w00; version 1; scope rule primary</p><select data-choice=\"w02\" aria-label=\"Scope w02\"><option value=\"incoming-internal\">incoming-internal</option><option value=\"incident-reader\">incident-reader</option><option value=\"external-contractor\">external-contractor</option></select><button data-op=\"w02\">Perform Resolve incoming team</button></article><article><strong>w03 \u00b7 Collect identity approval \u00b7 Backlog</strong><p>Prerequisites: w00; version 1; approval role Identity; scope rule primary</p><select data-choice=\"w03\" aria-label=\"Scope w03\"><option value=\"incoming-internal\">incoming-internal</option><option value=\"incident-reader\">incident-reader</option><option value=\"external-contractor\">external-contractor</option></select><button data-op=\"w03\">Perform Collect identity approval</button></article><article><strong>w04 \u00b7 Commit on-call access migration outcome 1 \u00b7 Backlog</strong><p>Prerequisites: w00, w01, w03; version 1; scope rule primary</p><select data-choice=\"w04\" aria-label=\"Scope w04\"><option value=\"incoming-internal\">incoming-internal</option><option value=\"incident-reader\">incident-reader</option><option value=\"external-contractor\">external-contractor</option></select><button data-op=\"w04\">Perform Commit on-call access migration outcome 1</button></article><article><strong>w05 \u00b7 Retire outgoing grant \u00b7 Backlog</strong><p>Prerequisites: w00, w02; version 1; scope rule primary</p><select data-choice=\"w05\" aria-label=\"Scope w05\"><option value=\"incoming-internal\">incoming-internal</option><option value=\"incident-reader\">incident-reader</option><option value=\"external-contractor\">external-contractor</option></select><button data-op=\"w05\">Perform Retire outgoing grant</button></article><article><strong>w06 \u00b7 Restore normal access service \u00b7 Backlog</strong><p>Prerequisites: w01, w03; version 1; scope rule primary</p><select data-choice=\"w06\" aria-lab